{"page":35,"width":1908,"height":2806,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"1.5 자원 관리","words":[{"text":"1.5","x":1407,"y":168,"width":52,"height":24},{"text":"자원","x":1476,"y":165,"width":47,"height":28},{"text":"관리","x":1534,"y":165,"width":47,"height":27}]},{"text":"77/0/ 설계에 3卜일된다. 각 알고리즘은 자기를 위한 하드웨어 지원이 필요하다.","words":[{"text":"77/0/","x":344,"y":305,"width":67,"height":39},{"text":"설계에","x":426,"y":306,"width":97,"height":38},{"text":"3卜일된다.","x":539,"y":306,"width":142,"height":38},{"text":"각","x":697,"y":307,"width":33,"height":37},{"text":"알고리즘은","x":743,"y":307,"width":171,"height":38},{"text":"자기를","x":926,"y":306,"width":103,"height":38},{"text":"위한","x":1043,"y":306,"width":69,"height":38},{"text":"하드웨어","x":1123,"y":305,"width":133,"height":39},{"text":"지원이","x":1276,"y":304,"width":98,"height":39},{"text":"필요하다.","x":1392,"y":302,"width":144,"height":40}]},{"text":"운영 체제는 메모리 관리와 관련하여 다음과 같은 일을 담당해야 한다.","words":[{"text":"운영","x":408,"y":370,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"체제는","x":480,"y":369,"width":99,"height":39},{"text":"메모리","x":593,"y":369,"width":95,"height":39},{"text":"관리와","x":705,"y":370,"width":103,"height":38},{"text":"관련하여","x":819,"y":370,"width":133,"height":38},{"text":"다음과","x":970,"y":370,"width":103,"height":38},{"text":"같은","x":1086,"y":370,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"일을","x":1168,"y":369,"width":67,"height":39},{"text":"담당해야","x":1248,"y":369,"width":139,"height":39},{"text":"한다.","x":1398,"y":368,"width":77,"height":38}]},{"text":"31","words":[{"text":"31","x":1659,"y":160,"width":35,"height":29}]},{"text":"• 메모리의 어느 부분이 현재 사용되고 있으며 어느 프로세스에 의해 시용되고 있는지","words":[{"text":"•","x":368,"y":475,"width":15,"height":16},{"text":"메모리의","x":410,"y":466,"width":132,"height":38},{"text":"어느","x":560,"y":466,"width":66,"height":38},{"text":"부분이","x":639,"y":467,"width":97,"height":37},{"text":"현재","x":754,"y":466,"width":63,"height":38},{"text":"사용되고","x":833,"y":466,"width":137,"height":39},{"text":"있으며","x":985,"y":466,"width":97,"hei